er Retirement", "segment_description": "(Studio: Peter Jennings)  Announcement by Walt Disney Co. CEO Michael Eisner that he will retire in 2006 reported.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64070.0", "legacy_segment_id": 765206, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BsmxIOYL6D", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 765197, "segment_id": "GSVuRp4HsY", "segment_broadcast_id": "BsmxIOYL6D", "segment_title": "Texas / Sex Education / Textbooks", "segment_description": "(Studio: Peter Jennings)  Report introduced.   (Washington: Lisa Stark)  The dispute in Texas over whether the sex education textbooks should mention condoms to help prevent pregnancy & AIDS or stress abstinence only examined; details given about the four textbooks being considered.  [Texas Freedom Network Samantha SMOOT&#134;- says Texas would make a mistake.]  [In Austin classroom, STUDENT; Texans for Life Coalition Kyleen WRIGHT&#134;- offer views on abstinence only.]  [American Textbook Council Gilbert SEWALL&#134;- says publishers are captives of pressure groups.]", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64090.0", "legacy_segment_id": 765207, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BsmxIOYL6D", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 765197, "segment_id": "JMQDTdlvC2", "segment_broadcast_id": "BsmxIOYL6D", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Wal-Mart; Prevacid; Neosporin ScarSolution; 1-800-Medicare; Senokot; \"Boston Legal\")", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 180, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "64230.0", "legacy_segment_id": 765208, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BsmxIOYL6D", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 765197, "segment_id": "5hOVIaZ1F7", "segment_broadcast_id": "BsmxIOYL6D", "segment_title": "Person of the Week (Craig Smith)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Peter Jennings)  Heart surgeon Dr. Craig Smith, who performed heart bypass surgery on former President Bill Clinton, profiled; details given of Smith's background in medicine & surgery.  [SMITH&nbsp- recounts learning something big was going on & that his decisions would be second-guessed; describes Clinton as a patient; talks about the fun of using new technology of surgery.]  [At press conference, SMITH&nbsp- says it was a \"routine\" operation.]", "segment_duration": 280, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64410.0", "legacy_segment_id": 765209, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BsmxIOYL6D", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 765197, "segment_id": "ZDt6Cakl41", "segment_broadcast_id": "BsmxIOYL6D", "segment_title": "Good Night", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64690.0", "legacy_segment_id": 765210, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}]}